# Replacement go and repeated stop preserve one bestmove per accepted search.
@phase 4.2
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< position startpos
< go infinite searchmoves e2e4
! allow-info begin
< go nodes 1 searchmoves d2d4
> bestmove e2e4{{PONDER}}
> bestmove d2d4
! allow-info end
< stop
< stop
! silence 100ms
< go
> info string invalid go: no search limit
< go movetime 10 wtime 1000
> info string invalid go: movetime conflicts with clock fields
< go movetime 1 searchmoves g1f3
! allow-info begin
> bestmove g1f3{{PONDER}}
! allow-info end
< go wtime 0 btime 0 searchmoves c2c4
! allow-info begin
> bestmove c2c4{{PONDER}}
! allow-info end
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms

---

# The worker reports bounded live root and completed-iteration information.
@phase 6.1
> Manta {{VERSION}} by Miloslav Macurek
< position startpos
< go infinite
! allow-info begin
> {{SEARCH_INFO}}
< isready
> readyok
< stop
> {{BESTMOVE_LINE}}
! allow-info end
< stop
! silence 100ms
< quit
! exit 0 within 1000ms
